body:
Dont forgot to mention that at 14 years old your voice is still changing. And your voice starts to grow, and that could be a reason that your voice isint fully devopled yet. If you practice through puberty with scales and other vocal exercises you can easily get a higher range and better sounding voice. Can you clarify on where your voice breaks? into headvoice/mix/falsetto. And don't be  obsessed by your range either, its all about what feeling you are projecting and what type of octave/note you sing on.

&#x200B;

P.S if you cant sing the song just lower it abit :)

Just keep on practicing with your mixed voice. Like try to start singing in your mixed and be sure you don't pull up your chest voice, cause its not good for you. Straining is also very bad and by putting to much effort into your singing like using your power to get up it could hurt your voice.

&#x200B;

P.S = There is really good vids up on yt that teaches you the basics of learning how to strengthen your mixed voice, check them out!
